{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-grothendieck-group-of-a-qou","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:grothendieck-group-of-a-qou","kind":"definition","title":"The Grothendieck group of a quantum universe","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-universe","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-simple-objects-V","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-rigid-monoidal-category"],"foreshadows":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-chern-character","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-su2-characters-and-quantum-dimension"],"cites":["references/bghl-2017","references/kassel1995"],"tags":["grothendieck-group","k-theory","wedderburn","quantum-dimension"],"defines":["grothendieck-group"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.GrothendieckChern.K0","text":"grothendieck-group-of-a-qou.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:grothendieck-group-of-a-qou\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a <a href=\"#def:quantum-universe\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/quantum-universe\">quantum universe</a> over the commutative ring <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>.</p>\n<p>The <strong><dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-grothendieck-group\">Grothendieck group</dfn></strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K_0(\\mathbf{C})</code> is the abelian group generated by the isomorphism classes <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[X]</code> of objects of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code>, subject to the relations <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[X \\oplus Y] = [X] + [Y]</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/grothendieck-group-of-a-qou.md","heading":"Definition","number":"3.4.14","page":"b/def-grothendieck-group-of-a-qou","qa":{"counts":{"pass":42,"fail":0,"warn":2,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":56},"milnor":{"total":1,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.GrothendieckChern.K0","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Core/GrothendieckChern.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
